    "source_text": "(4-aminopiperidin-1-yl)(5-chloro-1-methyl-1H-pyrazol-4-yl)methanone (442 mg, 1.82 mmol) was taken in a microwave tube. Added racemic-2,2'-Bis(diphenylphosphino)-1,1'-binaphthyl (113 mg, 0.18 mmol) followed by the addition of Palladium (II) acetate (40.9 mg, 0.18 mmol), racemic-2,2'-Bis(diphenylphosphino)-1,1'-binaphthyl (113 mg, 0.18 mmol), Cesium carbonate (1782 mg, 5.47 mmol) and diisopropylethyl amine(1ml). toluene (10 mL) was added and stirred at 140 °C for 8h.  After the completon of the reaction adsorbed the reaction mass on silica gel and purified by silica gel column.  ",
    "text_sha256": "6e52e784029c805e8cac3d4ba6acaad8ce44575f4e4950569646b3ce11001139",
